        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[無聊]]></summary>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="首先">首先<a href="https://aa10200809-svg.github.io/blog/my-blog-10/18#%E9%A6%96%E5%85%88" class="hash-link" aria-label="首先的直接連結" title="首先的直接連結" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<p>Today has been really boring. 早上在家彈琴，下午搭車，本來想在北車買摩斯
，結果薑絲牛肉珍珠堡缺貨，我就不買了
，然後原本事先買的高鐵票是19:21，因為時間提早，就想說搭前一班自由座好了! 結果排隊超滿，5節車廂都全滿，很扯欸！！！
台北上車還要站著，所以我就不搭了！搭本來買票那班就好</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="and-then">And then<a href="https://aa10200809-svg.github.io/blog/my-blog-10/18#and-then" class="hash-link" aria-label="And then的直接連結" title="And then的直接連結" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<p>然後就沒有然後了</p>
<p>突然想寫歌詞，啊可是我沒有歌欸，算了管他的</p>
<div class="language-text codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">沈默的訊息</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">無言的空氣</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">安靜的讓人窒息</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">採排著</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">試著不掉淚說出話</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">才發現根本做不到</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">背影和聲音</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">小巷和走廊</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">一句一句的挽回台詞</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">正在絕望中無聲吶喊 </span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">終究來到告別時刻</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">固執的手卻不放開</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">做著最後的掙扎</span><br></div></code></pre></div></div>]]></content>
    </entry>
